          "wiki/reference/search-and-output-shapes.md:5:frontmatter-key"
        ],
        "reason": "Every file in this skill is also a live wiki page. `title`/`summary` define page-hood, `tags` and `links-reviewed` carry certification, and the linter's frontmatter allowlist models none of them; the same frontmatter-without-`name` is why each non-SKILL page also trips opencode-name. Rewriting the frontmatter would drop 10 pages out of the wiki corpus, which is a separate decision from turning this check on."
